<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Dashboard - CreatorOS</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: #0a0a0a; color: #fff; }
    header { background: #111; border-bottom: 1px solid #222; padding: 16px 0; position: sticky; top: 0; }
    .header-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    .logo { font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; }
    .logo span { color: #d4a853; }
    .user-info { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
    .user-name { color: #888; font-size: 14px; }
    .logout-btn { padding: 8px 16px; background: transparent; border: 1px solid #333; color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; transition: all 0.3s; }
    .logout-btn:hover { border-color: #ff4444; color: #ff4444; }
    main { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .greeting span { color: #d4a853; }
    .subtitle { color: #666; margin-bottom: 40px; }
    .stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
    .stat-card { background: #111; border: 1px solid #222; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; transition: all 0.3s; }
    .stat-card:hover { border-color: #d4a853; }
    .stat-label { color: #888; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .stat-value { font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; color: #d4a853; }
    .section { background: #111; border: 1px solid #222; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .section h3 { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #d4a853; }
    .project-item { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 16px; background: #0a0a0a; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .project-title { font-weight: 600; }
    .project-status { padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; background: #d4a853; color: #000; }
    .progress-bar { width: 100%; height: 6px; background: #222; border-radius: 3px; margin-top: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
    .progress-fill { height: 100%; background: #d4a853; border-radius: 3px; }
    .insight-box { background: #0a0a0a; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #d4a853; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .insight-text { color: #ccc; font-size: 14px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="header-inner">
      <div class="logo">Creator<span>OS</span></div>
      <div class="user-info">
        <span class="user-name">Welcome, Creator!</span>
        <button class="logout-btn" onclick="goHome()">← Home</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h1 class="greeting">Good evening, <span>Alex</span></h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Your creator system is running at <strong>92%</strong> efficiency</p>

    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-label">Content Pipeline</div>
        <div class="stat-value">7</div>
        <div style="color:#666;font-size:12px;margin-top:4px;">Active projects</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-label">Engagement Rate</div>
        <div class="stat-value">4.8%</div>
        <div style="color:#666;font-size:12px;margin-top:4px;">↑ 23% vs last month</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-label">Creator Health</div>
        <div class="stat-value">87</div>
        <div style="color:#666;font-size:12px;margin-top:4px;">Excellent</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h3>Recent Projects</h3>
      <div class="project-item">
        <div>
          <div class="project-title">Video Script - "How I Built $10K MRR"</div>
          <div class="progress-bar"><div class="progress-fill" style="width:65%"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-status">In Progress</div>
      </div>
      <div class="project-item">
        <div>
          <div class="project-title">Blog Post - Content Strategy Guide</div>
          <div class="progress-bar"><div class="progress-fill" style="width:90%"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-status">Review</div>
      </div>
      <div class="project-item">
        <div>
          <div class="project-title">Podcast Episode - Creator Insights</div>
          <div class="progress-bar"><div class="progress-fill" style="width:45%"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-status">Planning</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h3>AI Insights</h3>
      <div class="insight-box">
        <div class="insight-text">📊 Tutorial-style content performs 3.2x better than listicles. Consider shifting Q3 strategy.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="insight-box">
        <div class="insight-text">✨ Your "stories" hook pattern shows 34% higher retention. Add to Brand Memory.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="insight-box">
        <div class="insight-text">📈 Best posting time: Tuesday 2-4 PM. Your audience is most active then.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <script>
    function goHome() {
      window.location.href = '/';
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
